# API Integration Skill

## Frontend Rules

* Use Axios instance
* Store baseURL in env
* Handle token automatically
* Centralize API calls

## Backend Rules

* Use RESTful naming
* Validate request payloads
* Return typed responses

## Error Handling

* Handle 401 globally
* Show user-friendly errors
* Log unexpected errors

## Example Endpoint Naming

```
GET /users
GET /users/{id}
POST /bookings
PATCH /bookings/{id}
DELETE /bookings/{id}
```
